      "content": "It is extremely unlikely that a single person can manually deactivate multiple accounts on different platforms just by clicking a button, as this would violate terms of service and your platforms would likely flag suspicious activity immediately. Your symptoms of being kicked off, seeing \"user not found\" errors, and losing sync suggest a more systemic issue, possibly related to a hanging process, localized device corruption, or a recent widespread platform update rather than targeted activity against you. To troubleshoot, try clearing your app cache or changing your passwords on all accounts, not to prevent attacks but to resolve any corrupted session tokens that might be causing these deceptive errors.",
